/ Until the email is verified the customer can browse but not book (BookingsController).
- if user_signed_in? && !current_user.confirmed?
  div class="border-b border-amber-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50" role="status"
    div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-amber-900 sm:px-6"
      p = t(".message", email: current_user.email)
      = button_to t(".resend"), user_confirmation_path, params: { user: { email: current_user.email } },
          class: "btn-secondary px-3.5 py-1 text-xs"
